# Local debugging debris. Anchored to the project root so a legitimately
# named source directory deeper in the tree is never swallowed.
# adb logcat captures and their pid/stderr sidecars; device-logcat3.txt
# alone is ~50 MB. Manual QA screenshots are re-captured on demand.
/device-logcat*.txt
/logcat*-pid.txt
/screenshots/
